    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:565ebob5f6hw33hjdkxty6qj/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2oup53nrs2k",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "I see a lot of snarky quote-posts here, but I do not see the \"alternate vision\" Brendan asked for. In a world where LLMs are clearly accelerating discovery in math and theoretical CS—and where 56% of US adults use them weekly—what is the plan? Is it \"wait for this to go away,\" as \"fad\" suggests?",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n2oup53nrs2k",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-19T20:06:36.428Z",
      "likes": 308,
      "replies": 32,
      "reposts": 41,
      "score": 7.4,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.6,
        "recency": 0.7,
        "age_hours": 45.8
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2qvqp4fts2e",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "Riemann Hypothesis may have been solved with the help of Claude. “what I saw during the course of progress so amazed me that I believe it is one dawn across science of something\nfar greater.” alpo.ge/remark.pdf",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n2qvqp4fts2e",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-20T15:30:42.096Z",
      "likes": 181,
      "replies": 13,
      "reposts": 24,
      "score": 7.3,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.4,
        "recency": 0.8,
        "age_hours": 26.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:flxq4uyjfotciovpw3x3fxnu/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2tj5d6rwc2m",
      "handle": "emollick.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Ethan Mollick",
      "text": "We really are in a (temporary?) place where a combination of expertise and being able to work with AI allows people to do incredible things. It is no coincidence that people proving Millennium Problems have all been great mathematicians, the models can't (yet) do it all on their own.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/emollick.bsky.social/post/3n2tj5d6rwc2m",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-21T16:23:06.373Z",
      "likes": 96,
      "replies": 4,
      "reposts": 9,
      "score": 7.1,
      "score_parts": {
        "engagement": 2.1,
        "recency": 1,
        "age_hours": 1.5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "at://did:plc:3igkkqe5nkm66olc4y2syzpy/app.bsky.feed.post/3n2tkmbhcac2p",
      "handle": "markriedl.bsky.social",
      "display_name": "Mark Riedl",
      "text": "Would be illuminating to track Anthropic employee giving behavior. As well as Anthropic the company itself, which is required in their charter to give a certain amount to charities.",
      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/markriedl.bsky.social/post/3n2tkmbhcac2p",
      "posted_at": "2026-11-21T16:49:21.614Z",
      "likes": 9,
